# L §5.10, E §4.2 step 5, L §4.4 A movement takes a day (tally 2.3, #247; the plan's S6 and the lead's ruling on C-3;
# the critic's hd_sign.tally): a check the walk makes against a hole balance isn't made, for a hole day as for a hole
# amount. pay_in, dated by a window, is a hole day, so owed is the hole on every day and pay_out, a plain movement out
# of it, books: other prints a value where one pinned day (04-03) refuses. Before: other's lines were the window's hole.
=== m.tally
model hd_sign
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "The critic: a hole-day movement into a place that can't go below zero, and a plain movement out of it. Whether the plain movement is refused depends on the unknown day; does the place it pays into still print a value?"
source card "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place owed: claims PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place other: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input out: money PLN
input pd: date
input out_day: date
move pay_in: transfers
  on pd
  leg cash from world to owed amount pay
move pay_out: transfers
  on out_day
  leg cash from owed to other amount out
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  out = 80.00 PLN "c"
  pd = window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) "c"
  out_day = 2026-04-02 "c"
  opening[owed] = 50.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[other] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
ask o_mar: bal(other, 2026-03-31)
ask o_apr5: bal(other, 2026-04-05)
ask o_apr5_p1: bal(other, 2026-04-05) with pd = 2026-04-01
ask o_apr5_p2: bal(other, 2026-04-05) with pd = 2026-04-02
ask o_apr5_p3: bal(other, 2026-04-05) with pd = 2026-04-03
ask w_apr5: bal(owed, 2026-04-05)
ask w_apr5_p3: bal(owed, 2026-04-05) with pd = 2026-04-03
ask f_other: flows(other, 2026-04)
ask f_other_p3: flows(other, 2026-04) with pd = 2026-04-03
ask n_out: count(t in transfers over 2026-04 where t.cash.to == other)
ask n_out_p3: count(t in transfers over 2026-04 where t.cash.to == other) with pd = 2026-04-03
=== expect
f_other: 80.00 PLN
...
f_other_p3: refused: RUN-PLACE owed is -30.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-04-02
...
n_out: 1
...
n_out_p3: refused: RUN-PLACE owed is -30.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-04-02
...
o_apr5: 580.00 PLN
...
o_apr5_p1: 580.00 PLN
...
o_apr5_p2: 580.00 PLN
...
o_apr5_p3: refused: RUN-PLACE owed is -30.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-04-02
...
o_mar: 500.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-20
w_apr5: ?"date within window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-03) not precise enough for the day of pay_in" (pd)
  unknown day: pd
...
w_apr5_p3: refused: RUN-PLACE owed is -30.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-04-02
...
